flowchart TD
    A["用户 Query → 构造 messages + system prompt"] --> C{"step < MAX_STEPS?"}
    C -->|"否"| D["返回：达到最大步数"]
    C -->|"是"| E["LLM.chat() 推理 + 决策"]
    E --> F{"finish_reason?"}
